	"은신처 귀환": "Return to Shelter",
	"은신처 음악: Streetlight Serenade © 2023 Shane Ivers\nhttps://www.silvermansound.com/free-music/streetlight-serenade\nCC BY 4.0 · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n변경: 음량 조정·시작과 끝 페이드·OGG 변환": "Shelter music: Streetlight Serenade © 2023 Shane Ivers\nhttps://www.silvermansound.com/free-music/streetlight-serenade\nCC BY 4.0 · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\nChanges: volume adjustment, fade-in/out and OGG conversion",
	"은신처로": "To Shelter",
	"은신처로 돌아가기": "Return to Shelter",
	"은신처로 복귀": "Return to Shelter",
	"은신처에서 선택한 곡 유지 · 출격 시 전투 음악으로 전환 · Tab / Enter로 선택 · Esc로 닫기": "Keeps your selected shelter track · Combat music on deployment · Tab / Enter to select · Esc to close",
